-## HOW TO ADD A HOOK
+```
+hooks/
+├── shared/                                  # Cross-hook helpers (timing, prompt builders, etc.)
+├── (50 hook directories — see tier tables above)
+├── zauc-mocks-bg, zauc-mocks-cache, …       # Test mocks (NOT hooks; named for sort-order isolation)
